#     Ben Amar, Eya and Ben Rached, Nadhir and Haji-Ali, Abdul-Lateef and
#     Tempone, Raúl (2023). State-dependent importance sampling for
#     estimating expectations of functionals of sums of independent random
#     variables. Statistics and Computing. doi:10.1007/s11222-022-10202-2
